<title>USA: Millennium, Lyondell see $100 mln one time gain.</title>
<headline>Millennium, Lyondell see $100 mln one time gain.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millennium Chemicals Inc and Lyondell Petrochemical Co expect to achieve one time savings of $100 million as a result of their ethylene and polyolefins joint venture.</p>
<p>The main saving of $60 million will come from a planned joint venture with Union Carbide Corp, in which each company had take a one third stake.</p>
<p>&quot;We both clearly do not need a stake a one third stake in the ethylene cracker,&quot; said Dan Smith, Lyondell's chief executive.</p>
</text>
